# A face without decorations: post's underline thickness and OS/2's
# strike-out size are zero, so neither band is drawn.
family Triergon Decorations None
units-per-em 1000
metrics 800 -200
underline 0 0
strikeout 0 0
heights 16384
modes outlines
glyph advance 500
end
glyph advance 600 char 0x41
  contour 100 0, 100 700, 500 700, 500 0
end
glyph advance 250 char 0x20
end
